<title>USA: Security Capital completes shr offering.</title>
<headline>Security Capital completes shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Capital Industrial Trust said on Friday that it completed an offering of 4,025,000 shares, raising net proceeds of $80.6 million.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to acquire and develop additional distribution properties in Security Capital's 36 target markets, the company said.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch was sole underwriter of the offering, Security Capital said.</p>
<p>Security Capital has 97.7 million shares after the offering.</p>
</text>
